{"seq":2,"slug":"spatial-composition","title":"空间构成与引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/level-design/spatial-composition","wordCount":1705,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"空间构成与引导\">空间构成与引导</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空间构成（Spatial Composition）是关卡设计的视觉语言——通过对空间形态、比例、层次和视线的精心编排，引导玩家在游戏世界中自然流动。空间构成不仅影响玩家的行动路径，更深层次地塑造情感体验：开阔的空间传递自由感，狭窄的通道制造压迫感，高耸的垂直空间激发敬畏感。</p>\n<p>空间引导（Spatial Guidance）是空间构成的功能性延伸。好的空间引导让玩家在探索中始终有方向感，即使没有明确的路标或 UI 提示。它利用人类的空间认知本能——我们天然被光亮吸引、向开阔处移动、沿视觉引线行进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[空间构成] --&gt; B[形态语言]&#10;    A --&gt; C[比例关系]&#10;    A --&gt; D[视线管理]&#10;    A --&gt; E[流动编排]&#10;    B --&gt; F[封闭/开放]&#10;    B --&gt; G[对称/不对称]&#10;    C --&gt; H[人体尺度]&#10;    C --&gt; I[夸张比例]&#10;    D --&gt; J[视觉焦点]&#10;    D --&gt; K[视线遮蔽]&#10;    E --&gt; L[主路径]&#10;    E --&gt; M[支路径]&#10;    E --&gt; N[隐藏路径]\">graph TD\n    A[空间构成] --&gt; B[形态语言]\n    A --&gt; C[比例关系]\n    A --&gt; D[视线管理]\n    A --&gt; E[流动编排]\n    B --&gt; F[封闭/开放]\n    B --&gt; G[对称/不对称]\n    C --&gt; H[人体尺度]\n    C --&gt; I[夸张比例]\n    D --&gt; J[视觉焦点]\n    D --&gt; K[视线遮蔽]\n    E --&gt; L[主路径]\n    E --&gt; M[支路径]\n    E --&gt; N[隐藏路径]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>空间类型</th>\n<th>形态特征</th>\n<th>情感效果</th>\n<th>游戏功能</th>\n<th>经典案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中枢空间</td>\n<td>大型开阔，多出口</td>\n<td>安全感、选择感</td>\n<td>路线交汇、任务分配</td>\n<td>传火祭祀场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性通道</td>\n<td>狭长单向</td>\n<td>紧迫感、方向感</td>\n<td>叙事推进、教学引导</td>\n<td>半条命走廊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞技场</td>\n<td>封闭对称</td>\n<td>紧张感、公平感</td>\n<td>Boss 战、PvP 对抗</td>\n<td>魂系列 Boss 房</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迷宫空间</td>\n<td>多路径交错</td>\n<td>探索欲、迷失感</td>\n<td>探索奖励、资源收集</td>\n<td>银河战士地图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>垂直空间</td>\n<td>纵深层叠</td>\n<td>敬畏感、挑战感</td>\n<td>平台跳跃、攀爬</td>\n<td>蔚蓝山峰章节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过渡空间</td>\n<td>连接性质</td>\n<td>期待感、缓冲</td>\n<td>节奏调节、氛围转换</td>\n<td>电梯、门廊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"视线控制与视觉焦点\">视线控制与视觉焦点</h2><p>视线控制（Sight Line Management）是空间引导中最强大的工具。人类的视觉系统具有选择性注意的特性——我们无法同时处理所有视觉信息，因此会被最突出的刺激吸引。设计者可以利用这一特性来&quot;编程&quot;玩家的注视方向。</p>\n<p><strong>维斯塔技法</strong>（Vista Technique）是一种通过远景展示来建立目标感的手法。当玩家到达关卡中的某个高点时，远处的目标建筑或地标清晰可见，建立了明确的空间导航锚点。这种技法在开放世界游戏中尤为重要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface VistaPoint {&#10;  position: Vector3;&#10;  targetLandmarks: Array&lt;{&#10;    name: string;&#10;    position: Vector3;&#10;    visualPriority: number;&#10;    revealCondition: string;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;  cameraOverride: {&#10;    fov: number;&#10;    lookAtTarget: Vector3;&#10;    transitionDuration: number;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SightLineConfig {&#10;  origin: Vector3;&#10;  direction: Vector3;&#10;  maxDistance: number;&#10;  obstructions: Obstruction[];&#10;  attractor: {&#10;    type: &#39;light&#39; | &#39;color&#39; | &#39;motion&#39; | &#39;contrast&#39;;&#10;    intensity: number;&#10;    position: Vector3;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function evaluateSightLine(config: SightLineConfig): SightLineResult {&#10;  const effectiveDistance = calculateClearDistance(config.origin, config.direction, config.obstructions);&#10;&#10;  const attractorVisible = effectiveDistance &gt;= distance(config.origin, config.attractor.position);&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    clearDistance: effectiveDistance,&#10;    attractorVisible,&#10;    effectiveIntensity: attractorVisible ? config.attractor.intensity / (effectiveDistance * effectiveDistance) : 0,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VistaPoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetLandmarks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    visualPriority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    revealCondition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cameraOverride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fov</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lookAtTarget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    transitionDuration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SightLineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  origin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxDistance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  obstructions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Obstruction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  attractor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'light'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'color'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'motion'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'contrast'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    intensity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluateSightLine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SightLineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SightLineResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> effectiveDistance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateClearDistance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.origin, config.direction, config.obstructions);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> attractorVisible</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effectiveDistance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.origin, config.attractor.position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    clearDistance: effectiveDistance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attractorVisible,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    effectiveIntensity: attractorVisible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.attractor.intensity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (effectiveDistance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effectiveDistance) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>视觉焦点的层次化设计采用&quot;主-次-补&quot;三级结构：</p>\n<p><strong>主焦点</strong>——整个场景中最突出的元素，通常是玩家的下一个目标。使用最强烈的视觉吸引手段：高对比度颜色、动态光源或大比例物体。</p>\n<p><strong>次焦点</strong>——辅助导航和探索的元素。如道具拾取点、可交互机关、支线入口。使用中等强度的视觉暗示。</p>\n<p><strong>补焦点</strong>——丰富环境细节和氛围的元素。它们不需要立即被注意到，但当玩家仔细观察时能提供额外的信息或奖励。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 视觉优先级&#10;        P1[主焦点 - 强吸引] --&gt; P2[次焦点 - 中吸引]&#10;        P2 --&gt; P3[补焦点 - 弱吸引]&#10;    end&#10;    P1 --&gt; T1[目标方向/出口]&#10;    P2 --&gt; T2[道具/机关/支路]&#10;    P3 --&gt; T3[环境细节/隐藏物]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 视觉优先级\n        P1[主焦点 - 强吸引] --&gt; P2[次焦点 - 中吸引]\n        P2 --&gt; P3[补焦点 - 弱吸引]\n    end\n    P1 --&gt; T1[目标方向/出口]\n    P2 --&gt; T2[道具/机关/支路]\n    P3 --&gt; T3[环境细节/隐藏物]</pre><h2 id=\"路径设计与流动编排\">路径设计与流动编排</h2><p>路径设计（Pathing Design）定义了玩家在空间中的移动方式。优秀的路径设计创造&quot;有意义的选择&quot;——每条路径都有其独特的风险/回报比，玩家的选择反映了个人风格和策略偏好。</p>\n<p>路径的基本类型包括：</p>\n<p><strong>主路径</strong>（Critical Path）——完成关卡目标的最直接路线。它应当清晰可见且始终可达，是大多数玩家的首选。</p>\n<p><strong>旁路</strong>（Side Path）——偏离主路径的短暂分支，通常通向额外奖励或叙事片段。好的旁路让玩家&quot;看见&quot;分支的存在（可见的岔路口），但不强制探索。</p>\n<p><strong>隐藏路径</strong>（Secret Path）——需要细心观察或特殊操作才能发现的路线。它们是对探索精神的奖励，通常通向稀有物品或捷径。</p>\n<p><strong>捷径</strong>（Shortcut）——连接已探索区域的新通道，减少回溯的枯燥感。在互联型关卡（如黑暗之魂）中，捷径的开启本身就是一种强烈的进度反馈。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PathNetwork {&#10;  nodes: PathNode[];&#10;  edges: PathEdge[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PathNode {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  position: Vector3;&#10;  type: &#39;junction&#39; | &#39;destination&#39; | &#39;checkpoint&#39; | &#39;secret&#39;;&#10;  interestLevel: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PathEdge {&#10;  from: string;&#10;  to: string;&#10;  pathType: &#39;critical&#39; | &#39;side&#39; | &#39;secret&#39; | &#39;shortcut&#39;;&#10;  difficulty: number;&#10;  estimatedTime: number;&#10;  rewards: string[];&#10;  bidirectional: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function analyzeCriticalPath(network: PathNetwork): PathAnalysis {&#10;  const criticalEdges = network.edges.filter((e) =&gt; e.pathType === &#39;critical&#39;);&#10;  const totalTime = criticalEdges.reduce((sum, e) =&gt; sum + e.estimatedTime, 0);&#10;  const avgDifficulty = criticalEdges.reduce((sum, e) =&gt; sum + e.difficulty, 0) / criticalEdges.length;&#10;&#10;  const sideContent = network.edges.filter((e) =&gt; e.pathType !== &#39;critical&#39;);&#10;  const explorationRatio = sideContent.length / criticalEdges.length;&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    criticalPathTime: totalTime,&#10;    averageDifficulty: avgDifficulty,&#10;    explorationRatio,&#10;    secretCount: network.nodes.filter((n) =&gt; n.type === &#39;secret&#39;).length,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">i